                  %a{:href => "https://people.mpim-bonn.mpg.de/teichner/Math/ewExternalFiles/DimZero.pdf"} pdf
          %h3#as_locally_ringed_spaces_2 As locally ringed spaces
          %ul
            %li#BerezinLeites75
              %p
